  "maps": {
    "86": {
      "name": "Route 2 (South)",
      "events": {
        "34": {
          "name": "EV034 (Speed-up key tip sign)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Ranger Notice: Is the game ",
                    "too slow for your liking? ",
                    "You can press the speed-up ",
                    "key in and out of battles ",
                    "to make it go faster!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "47": {
          "name": "EV047 (Oak's assistant — HA outbreak)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "self_switch": "A"
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's me, Prof. Oak's",
                    "research assistant!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I was collecting field data",
                    "nearby and I came across",
                    "something remarkable. You",
                    "have to see this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 19,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It seems like there's an",
                    "outbreak of wild Pok\u00e9mon",
                    "with <b>Hidden Abilities</b>",
                    "on this route!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 25,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I spotted one of them in",
                    "this very patch of grass!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You can tell when a route",
                    "has a Hidden Ability",
                    "outbreak by the way the",
                    "wild Pok\u00e9mon sparkle in",
                    "battles."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 32,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is a very rare event.",
                    "Prof. Oak thinks Hidden",
                    "Abilities may be linked to",
                    "natural fusion potential.",
                    "We're still studying it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But I don't expect it to",
                    "last very long, so you",
                    "should try to catch one of",
                    "these rare Pok\u00e9mon while",
                    "you still have the chance!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 40,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'd better get back to the",
                    "lab and report this to the",
                    "professor. Good luck with",
                    "your Pok\u00e9mon League",
                    "challenge!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "92": {
      "name": "Route 2 (North)",
      "events": {
        "2": {
          "name": "EV002 (Abra-for-Mr. Mime trade)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've been researching how",
                    "Psychic-types resist fusion",
                    "instability. I need an Abra",
                    "for my next test. Trade me",
                    "one for my Mr. Mime?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "No? That's a shame."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "OK, let's get started."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thanks! This will really",
                    "help my research."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Such is life..."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {
                "self_switch": "A"
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
